  "explanation": "The signs repeat in a cycle of three kinds: movable (Aries, Cancer, Libra, Capricorn) read as initiating and active; fixed (Taurus, Leo, Scorpio, Aquarius) read as steady and enduring; dual (Gemini, Virgo, Sagittarius, Pisces) read as adaptable and mixed.",
