  "explanation": "The signs alternate: odd signs (Aries, Gemini, Leo, Libra, Sagittarius, Aquarius) are classed as masculine and harder, even signs (Taurus, Cancer, Virgo, Scorpio, Capricorn, Pisces) as feminine and gentler. The classes describe tone, not gender of people.",
